@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Market buy of 10 shares: FILLED at the latest close
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10}

### Limit buy for an amount of pesos: NEW, for the whole shares it buys
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "amount": 10000, "price": 900}

### More shares than the user has: stored as REJECTED (201) with the reason
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1000}

### Market order for an instrument without market data: REJECTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": 1, "instrumentId": 3, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1}

### Both size and amount (400, nothing stored)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1, "amount": 1000}

### A seed order that is still open
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/7

### Cancel it (200, then 409 if sent again)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/7/cancel

### A filled order cannot be cancelled (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/2/cancel

### Unknown order (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/999
